|---|---|---|
| 60 / 50 | **1** | **Alt-A** — always legal, the reading was poisoned. Claim wrong |
| 60 / 50 | 0 | genuinely bad wire despite tunnels; then `wire_indicators` + re-read — if *that* reaches 1, the claim was right |
